id=zram_lz4kd_8192
name=ZRAM LZ4KD 16GB
version=1.2
versionCode=3
author=Samshi
description=At boot: set zram0 to lz4kd with a 16 GiB disksize and vm.swappiness=200. Requires a kernel with CRYPTO_LZ4KD (FrierenKernel LZ4KD build) and KernelSU. v1.2: 16 GiB + max swappiness; v1.1: toybox mkswap/swapon by absolute path.
